{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1467785-2nd-edition-bloodline-bloodsympathy","id":1467785,"title":"2nd edition Bloodline-Bloodsympathy","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-11-14T06:08:06-08:00","id":1467785,"title":"2nd edition Bloodline-Bloodsympathy","content":"So I'm having a conversation with my St.<br /> How it goes: for example a Mekhet and a venture join the ICELUS bloodline do they have Blood sympathy?Cuz they are not the same clan but the same Bloodline. Becouse there is nowhere writing it.<br /> Thanks in advance!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26729-r1pftw","name":"R1pftw","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-14T12:00:13-08:00","id":1467808,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>R1pftw</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1467785-2nd-edition-bloodline-bloodsympathy#post1467785\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So I'm having a conversation with my St.<br /> How it goes: for example a Mekhet and a venture join the ICELUS bloodline do they have Blood sympathy?Cuz they are not the same clan but the same Bloodline. Becouse there is nowhere writing it.<br /> Thanks in advance!</div> </div> </div> </div>Bloodlines don't share any special blood sympathy by default, so although the Mekhet and Ventrue branches of the Icelus are &quot;related&quot; to each other, they don't count for blood ties (unless you're doing Coil of the Voivode shenanigans). That said, it definitely wouldn't break the game if you consider cross-lineage bloodlines effectively clan mates for that purpose.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><b>Social justice vampire/freelancer | He/Him</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Actual Play:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/852858-vampire-the-requiem-%E2%80%93-bloodlines-ap\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire: The Requiem \u2013 Bloodlines</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Masquiem:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/5268-13-licks-the-curses-of-caine-in-blood-smoke\" target=\"_blank\">Curses of Caine in Requiem 2nd</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Storytellers Vault: </b></span><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=None%20More%20Dark%20Publishing#affiliate_id=321925\" target=\"_blank\">Author Page</a>","edited":{"userid":192,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/192-yossarian","user":"Yossarian","date":". 11-14-2021, 04:21 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/192-yossarian","name":"Yossarian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-15T04:38:11-08:00","id":1467865,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>R1pftw</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1467785-2nd-edition-bloodline-bloodsympathy#post1467785\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So I'm having a conversation with my St.<br /> How it goes: for example a Mekhet and a venture join the ICELUS bloodline do they have Blood sympathy?Cuz they are not the same clan but the same Bloodline. Becouse there is nowhere writing it.<br /> Thanks in advance!</div> </div> </div> </div>It's whatever your ST says it is for the setting. The book says blood sympathy is strongest along the sire/childe line but that it branches out to clan. Bloodlines aren't mentioned because the vast majority of them are single clan. If it's a case where a bloodline can avus in other clans then it can be chalked up that that particular bloodline is too weak to facilitate blood sympathy between all its members or that it's an unintended weakness that blood sympathy can be exploited by non clan and nonbloodline members.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5466-tsusasi","name":"tsusasi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5466_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1028"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}